     with_clause return_clause proj_items proj_item order_limit sort_item count proc_name (20) |
     pattern_list path group_pat node_pat label_expr edge_pat edge_body quantifier prop_map (9) |
     expr and_expr not_expr pred_expr cmp_op add_expr mul_expr unary_expr postfix_expr primary
     path_pred subquery func_call args arg list_lit map_lit case_expr literal (19) |
     revspec rev_base rev_suffix rev_arg (4)                         2 + 20 + 9 + 19 + 4 = 54
   §6, 15: tx tx_option tx_stmt tx_name expect mutation delete_opt target edge_step create_stmt
     resolve_stmt define_stmt param_decl type qname                                        15
   §7, 13: ident node_lit param int float duration string seq_lit commit_lit ref_name ref_seg
     ref_word datetime                                                                     13
   The only change to [50 §2.3]'s text is rev_suffix's fourth alternative (Open point O-2); the
   count is unchanged.
   ============================================================================================= *)


